= Introduction

leoj.de ("we," "us," or "our") operates an invoice and payment management application (the "Service"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your personal data when you use our Service, in accordance with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and German data protection laws (Bundesdatenschutzgesetz - BDSG).

= Controller Information

The data controller responsible for your personal data is:

