= Additional Information for German Users

== Rechtsgrundlagen (Legal Bases)

This policy complies with BDSG (Bundesdatenschutzgesetz) in addition to GDPR requirements.

== Auftragsverarbeiter (Processors)

All our processors have signed AVV (Auftragsverarbeitungsverträge) as required under German law.

== Betroffenenrechte (Data Subject Rights)

All rights described in Section 9 are available to you without charge for the first request. Subsequent manifestly unfounded or excessive requests may incur a reasonable administrative fee.

